<!-- Packed variants of the diagnostics that can safely be written as
     16-bit integers.  Each field here is the field of the same name
     without the _pk suffix, packed onto the range agreed in
     ps49_packing.xlsx: scale_factor is (max-min)/65535 and add_offset is
     min + 32768 * scale_factor, so min and max land exactly on the ends
     of the signed 16-bit range.  Values outside the range are clipped.
     Reference these from a file_def in place of the unpacked field to
     halve the data volume of that diagnostic. -->
